' The search and filter cluster in the title row (RFC 0009, "Controls"). It is one line and
' always visible. The ▾ inside the input appears while there is text and converts the typed
' criterion into a keep or hide chip. The funnel's badge is the number of active chips.
@startsalt
{
<b>No text, no filters</b>
{+
  { "<&magnifying-glass> Find…                  " | . | [↑] | [↓] | [⌖] | [▼] }
}
.
<b>Text typed, three filters active</b>
{+
  { "<&magnifying-glass> "tools/call" auth   <back:#fff3bf>▾</back>" | 12 · <b>47 hidden</b> | [↑] | [↓] | [⌖] | [<back:#fff3bf>▼ <b>3</b></back>] }
}
.
<b>The ▾ menu inside the input</b>
{+
  <color:#2b8a3e><&eye></color> Keep matching spans
  <color:#c92a2a><&eye></color> Hide matching spans
}
}
@endsalt
